{"server":"tw","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_04_beg","groupId":"act43side","stageId":"act43side_04","title":"一個荒唐的早晨","storyCode":"AD-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act43side/level_act43side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"d3641b204679cb0897f08d4949009bb05b58adc78ce6865a17fcbdce68b09360","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g2_setting_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勞拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1848_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道爾頓先生，您竟然真的幫我多要了一場戲……還是空中懸吊的特技鏡頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勞拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1848_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前不管我怎麼求斯蒂芬導演他都不願意，您一說他竟然就答應了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"道爾頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_1837_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼啦。我是格蕾塔女士親自請來的男主角，斯蒂芬怎麼敢不答應我的要求？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勞拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1848_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是第一次接觸吊鋼絲……一定會好好珍惜這次機會的！我先去準備了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"道爾頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_1837_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"道爾頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_1837_1","isRemote":false,"text":"裝得倒是很謙卑，要是我不知道你暗地裡找斯蒂芬想動我主演的戲份，大概就被你騙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"道爾頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_1837_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次接觸吊鋼絲……正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"道爾頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_1837_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新人就應該有新人的姿態，就算到時候在天上吊他幾個小時，也得撐住，對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勞拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1848_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝莉，謝莉！我又新加了一場戲，需要用到吊鋼絲，你可以幫我準備一下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你很愛演戲，我也知道你很有熱情，但你這是第幾次新加戲了？你這是第幾次擾亂我為整個劇組制定的拍攝進度了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大小姐，你有一點點責任心嗎？我不會為了你這樣輕飄飄的一句話改動整個排期，這個劇組不是你一個人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勞拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1848_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉謝莉，我不是故意要增加你的工作難度，但是道爾頓先生說他已經徵得了導演的同意，這個應該是已經確定了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道爾頓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勞拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1848_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，謝莉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（道爾頓昨天才和我一起罵你，說你這個新人一點規矩都沒有，怎麼可能今天就好心幫你加戲。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（吊鋼絲，是吧……）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g12_dressingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，小勞拉，你今天看起來真是光彩照人啊！下一場空中特技鏡頭又累又苦，沒有一個演員像你這麼高興呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勞拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1848_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在是我最興奮最幸福的時候了。下一場戲是這部電影裡唯一一場完完整整屬於我的戲份，我一定要把它拍好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你真是太可愛了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心不要受傷了哦，如果實在累得不行就來找我，今天晚上我會一直在自己的房間裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勞拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1848_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！瑪麗昂小姐，你是來幫邁克爾先生補妝的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1839_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"勞拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1848_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先去做準備了，晚點再見！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1839_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見什麼見！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不見……不見……你別生氣啊小瑪麗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1839_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一下子沒注意，你就開始拈花惹草了？我們才在一起多久你就厭倦了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1839_1","isRemote":false,"text":"演戲的時候就在眉來眼去……喜歡年輕的就去找她啊！幹嘛還跟我在一起？之後的妝髮造型你也讓勞拉幫你做吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說氣話，親愛的。我對你是真心誠意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的不喜歡，我以後再也不主動接觸她了，我發誓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1839_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1839_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1839_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你的那點小毛病，但現在正是你事業的上升期，不要做那些蠢事，也不要辜負我對你的心意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1839_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個叫勞拉的年輕女生又吵又愛出風頭，一定不單純，不值得你花心思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1839_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從現在開始，不准主動接近她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1839_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能跟她說話，也不能有肢體接觸，就算她快死了都跟你沒有關係……聽懂了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"親愛的？"},{"type":"narration","text":"瑪麗昂的眼神告訴他，她沒開玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，我答應你，都聽你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g2_setting_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼還沒到我的戲份啊，發生什麼事情了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1845_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道爾頓先生那裡有些事要處理，片場的人都調過去了，沒有人給我下達指示……你看，還有一個新人被丟在這裡呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真可憐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1845_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才不是什麼很有同情心的人，說吧，是不是想搭訕人家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是你懂我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我去看看那個可憐的小美女……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小瑪麗早上剛生過氣，我答應過她不再主動接近小勞拉……不過……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓她主動接近我不就好了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"邁克爾抬頭向上看，勞拉纖瘦的身體被吊在空中，汗水一滴滴流下，浸濕了一小片地板。\n女孩的神情有些疲憊，眼神卻依舊堅定，隱隱刺痛了邁克爾玩世不恭的心。\n吊掛繩索咯吱咯吱地發出聲響，邁克爾可以憑經驗判斷，勞拉穿戴的裝置一定有什麼不對勁的地方。\n不過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是剛剛好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小勞拉察覺到情況不對就會主動向我求救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣一來我既會成為她心目中的英雄，順理成章地跟她親熱一下，又不算違反我對小瑪麗發的誓……兩全其美！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再多吊一下吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g2_setting_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勞拉，為什麼……為什麼你還不向別人求助？我不是就在這裡嗎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經過去了好幾個小時，繩索的聲音越來越不對勁了……這是從哪裡拿來的設備，怎麼會如此老舊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡……裂開了？在安全綁帶的位置？小勞拉不可能沒注意到啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，我要提醒她，我要……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"往前走的時候，邁克爾踩到了濕滑的水漬，在聚光燈強烈的高溫中，勞拉脫水狀況越來越明顯。\n這是邁克爾永遠無法理解的堅持和熱愛，眼前這個女孩彷彿否定了他從業以來的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1839_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。"},{"type":"narration","text":"邁克爾回頭，發現瑪麗昂不知何時已經站在遠處的牆角，眼神冰冷地看著自己和疲憊的女演員。\n“就算她快死了都跟你沒有關係……聽懂了嗎？”\n邁克爾摸了摸頭頂火紅的耳朵，收回了自己的腳步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……既然你選擇自己承受代價，那就跟我沒有任何關係了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你要學的第一課，小勞拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"永遠不要太認真，哪怕傷害他人也要保護自己，這才是最重要的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咯吱，咯吱。\n頂端的繩索已經拉伸到了極限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還不求救嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g12_dressingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1839_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁克爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1839_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁克爾，你怎麼了？你想到什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1839_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟你來到化妝間是要聽你解釋的，不是看你大驚小怪地發神經……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪麗昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1839_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫伊拉說，你想離開這個地塊，到底是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁克爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"親愛的，我得帶著你逃離這裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你第一次離開古堡，跟著劇團到這麼遠的地方演出吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1841_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"緊張嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1841_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……還好，老師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1841_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他老師們才是主角，我只是一個很小很小的配角，在舞台上絕大多數的戲份也只是旁觀……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但當真正的演出在你面前發生，忍住不逃開，並沒有那麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，這是你新的一課。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g6_towerterrace"},{"type":"narration","text":"萊塔尼亞，魯珀坎大區，某高塔"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（鼓掌）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"精彩的演出。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自從順利完成自己第一次作為主角的劇目後，你終於突破了瓶頸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你頸部細小的黑色結晶被遮掩得不留痕跡。觀眾只認為你是璀璨奪目的主角，卻不知你已成為迫近死亡的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，你的表演越來越純熟，你的歌聲越來越震撼人心，盧西恩……幾乎看不出一絲匠氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是誇獎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不走嗎？還是說，你想要在這裡多待一陣子，再享受一下舞台的餘韻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"餘韻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指，這些血腥味？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_y"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懵懂的孩童","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥哥，借過一下，你擋到路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懵懂的孩童","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要過去，我要回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，猩紅劇團可以收留這個孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收留？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她並不知曉，自己的家鄉已經不復存在，她並不知曉，此刻自己面前的這支隊伍裡，或許有些人身上還殘留著她至親的血腥味……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宿命的相逢，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像曾經的你與劇團一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許，我應該讓你來當這個孩子的老師，教她怎樣融入劇團、怎樣擁抱新的人生……教她，重走一遍你的來路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下台之後，演出繼續？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，你還記得我說過的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，生活本身便是最好的戲劇，宿命的美學從不局限於載體。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懵懂的孩童","speakerId":"avg_npc_045_nn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……大哥哥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉淵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1833_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧西恩，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉淵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1833_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你考慮清楚了嗎？現在的你，應該能決定了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g10_dormitory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miss.Christine","speakerId":"avg_4198_christ_1","isRemote":false,"text":"清醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miss.Christine","speakerId":"avg_4198_christ_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（慵懶的哈欠）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miss.Christine","speakerId":"avg_4198_christ_1","isRemote":false,"text":"固執的澀味……你的情緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難以下嚥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miss.Christine","speakerId":"avg_4198_christ_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不至於。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miss.Christine","speakerId":"avg_4198_christ_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過來到這個地塊以後，你回想過往的次數越來越多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這說明我們正在靠近他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miss.Christine","speakerId":"avg_4198_christ_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你敏銳地察覺到了那個統籌的異樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟你一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遺憾的是，我尚未能挖出更多的線索，她的慘劇便已經發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miss.Christine","speakerId":"avg_4198_christ_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你利用了那個攝影助理，故意抖出天災的消息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那份文件出現的時機和方式都太過巧合了，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"參演過足夠多的劇目，便不難知曉，當這樣明顯的線索出現在我們面前，它便一定會發揮作用，推動故事往下進行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道爾頓的死，只是一個開頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的伏筆已被鋪陳，一切的脈絡已被寫定，沒有人能扯回已經拉開的序幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯有讓故事來到謝幕前的高潮，作者才會現身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……而我才能，殺死他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miss.Christine","speakerId":"avg_4198_christ_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哈欠）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miss.Christine","speakerId":"avg_4198_christ_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心一點，盧西恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miss.Christine","speakerId":"avg_4198_christ_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說，小心你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miss.Christine","speakerId":"avg_4198_christ_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛說過，你的情緒，充滿了固執的澀味……這很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向你道歉，Miss.Christine。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會讓你忍受太久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
